{"id":"12768269414f5f5d","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-delta0-formula.md","title":"Delta-0 Formula","display":"df-delta0-formula — Delta-0 Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-delta0-formula","aliases":["88-df-delta0-formula"],"display":"df-delta0-formula — Delta-0 Formula","depends_on":["[[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]","[[88-df-bounded-quantifier]]","[[88-df-atomic-formula]]","[[./88-df-term]]","[[88-df-variable]]","[[88-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-delta0-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-delta0-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-delta0-formula — Delta-0 Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"82e0f59361ca6e46\" href=\"?note=82e0f59361ca6e46\" title=\"88-df-bounded-quantifier\">88-df-bounded-quantifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9df3c26c280af75a\" href=\"?note=9df3c26c280af75a\" title=\"88-df-atomic-formula\">88-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithForm}\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithForm}\\)</span> (arithmetical-formula class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> (atomic arithmetic formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9df3c26c280af75a\" href=\"?note=9df3c26c280af75a\" title=\"88-df-atomic-formula\">88-df-atomic-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> (arithmetic terms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> (variables, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> (term-variable map, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta0\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\Delta_0\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\nD\\subseteq\\mathrm{ArithForm}:\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\subseteq D\n\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\;\n\\bigl(\\neg\\varphi\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in D\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in D\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\;\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\notin\\mathrm{var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(t)\n\\to\n\\bigl((\\exists x&lt;t\\,\\varphi)\\in D\\land(\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\varphi)\\in D\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta0\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\Delta_0\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\nD\\subseteq\\mathrm{ArithForm}:\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\subseteq D\n\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\;\n\\bigl(\\neg\\varphi\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in D\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in D\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\;\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\notin\\mathrm{var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(t)\n\\to\n\\bigl((\\exists x&lt;t\\,\\varphi)\\in D\\land(\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\varphi)\\in D\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>公式的量词都是受限的</li>\n<li>在标准自然数结构中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>公式定义的关系是可判定的；反向表示\n能力依赖所选算术签名，不能仅由“可判定”一词替代句法定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>公式是有界算术的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","lev